.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK ATTRIBUTE OPTION RENAME"
.SH NAME
hamstik attribute option rename \- Rename an option's display label without changing its key
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik attribute option rename [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Rename an option's display label without changing its key
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ATTRIBUTE_KEY
Stable Attribute key
.TP
.I OPTION_KEY
Stable option key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --label
New display label
.TP
.B --reason
Optional audit reason
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
